flowchart TD
    START([Start: User Taps Create Budget]) --> FORM[Display Budget Setup Form]
    FORM --> MONTH[User Selects Month/Year - Default Current Month]
    MONTH --> TOTAL[User Enters Total Budget Amount]
    TOTAL --> CATS[Display Predefined Category List]
    CATS --> ALLOC[User Allocates Amount to Each Category]
    ALLOC --> REMAIN[Real-Time: Calculate Remaining Unallocated Amount]
    REMAIN --> CHECK{Total Allocations within Total Budget?}
    CHECK -- No --> ERR[Display Error and Prevent Save]
    ERR --> FORM
    CHECK -- Yes --> POST[Send POST Request to /budgets]
    POST --> BVAL[Backend Validates Data]
    BVAL --> BVALID{Valid?}
    BVALID -- No --> BERR[Return 400 Error]
    BERR --> ERRDISP[Display Error Message]
    ERRDISP --> FORM
    BVALID -- Yes --> RECORD[Create Budget Record]
    RECORD --> CATROWS[Create BudgetCategory Records for Each Category]
    CATROWS --> INIT[Initialize SpentAmount = 0.00 for All Categories]
    INIT --> RESP[Return Success Response]
    RESP --> OVERVIEW[Display Budget Overview with Progress Bars at 0%]
    OVERVIEW --> DONE([End])
